    {
      "id": 15,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read RTO here",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 20,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**RPO** is measured continuously from the backup store.\n\n**RTO cannot be measured continuously.** It is demonstrated by drills. Observed in the [2026-11-21 game day](https://github.com/ManuJacks/kubernetes-in-finance/blob/main/docs/gameday/2026-11-21-api-availability.md): load-balancer crash failover **3.6 s**, HAProxy failure **5.3 s**, etcd leader loss **no full outage**. These are lab measurements, not guarantees."
      }
    },
